<title>USA: Trade estimates for USDA grain export inspections.</title>
<headline>Trade estimates for USDA grain export inspections.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade estimates for the weekly</p>
<p>U.S. grain and soybean export inspections due from the U.S.</p>
<p>Agriculture Department Monday around 1000 CDT are as follows,</p>
<p>in millions of bushels.</p>
<p>		     Range	    prev week</p>
<p> Soybeans	 5.0 to 9.0	   5,914</p>
<p> Wheat	   12.0 to 20.0	 10,216</p>
<p> Corn	    24.0 to 30.0	 29,964</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
